    "preamble": "Sachin Kumar vs The State Of Rajasthan ... on 28 May, 2024 Author: Nupur Bhati Bench: Nupur Bhati [2024:Rj-Jd:24404] High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur S.B. Civil Writ Petition No. 8048/2024 1. Sachin Kumar S/o Prithvi Raj, Aged About 26 Years, R/o Near Ward No. 14, Court Road, Near Jama Masjid, Tehsil Sangaria, Dist Hanumangarh. 2. Dr. Rinet Sonija Dsouza S/o Thomas Dsouza, Aged About 41 Years, At Present Resident Of Near Ward No. 14, Court Road, Near Jama Masjid, Tehsil- Sangaria, District- Hanumangarh. ----Petitioners Versus 1. The State Of Rajasthan, Through The Secretary To The Government, Department Of Medical, Health And Family Welfare, Government Of Rajasthan, Secretariat, Jaipur. 2. Commissioner, Food Safety And Drug Control, Rajasthan, Commissionerate, Swasthya Bhawan, Tilak Marg, C- Scheme, Jaipur, Rajasthan. 3. Controlling Authority And Drug Controller, Rajasthan Food Safety And Drug Control, Commissionerate, Swasthya Bhawan, Tilak Marg, C-Scheme, Jaipur, Rajasthan . 4. Assistant Drug Controller, Drug Control Office, New Civil Lines, Hanumangarh (Raj.) ----Respondents For Petitioner(s) : Mr. B.S. Sandhu For Respondent(s) : Mr. Mahaveer Bishnoi, AAG with Mr. Gaurav Bishnoi HON'BLE DR. JUSTICE NUPUR BHATI Order 28/05/2024 1. Learned counsel representing the petitioners seeks permission to withdraw the present writ petition with the liberty to file afresh if occasion arises. [2024:RJ-JD:24404] (2 of 2) [CW-8048/2024 ] Sachin Kumar vs The State Of Rajasthan ... on 28 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/63096449/",
